    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hot adventure on the beach sands! A tourist finds himself in an embarrassing situation after being robbed by a bikini bombshell. To recover his belongings, he'll have to face the wrath of the beachgoers and the law, all without losing his clothes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A side-splitting arcade experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459370/extras/43bdd37b50224e6fd9b677b78821dd2a.poster.avif?t=1753125922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459370/extras/43bdd37b50224e6fd9b677b78821dd2a.webm?t=1753125922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fight with your fists, lobsters, coconuts, and Molotovs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459370/extras/5e8c5b9670050598ab1978a702bf6cb3.poster.avif?t=1753125922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459370/extras/5e8c5b9670050598ab1978a702bf6cb3.webm?t=1753125922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Stay dressed to impress! Three endings await those who keep their clothes on:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459370/extras/ae6f82788f2e4b9f0979228b6e4c9da4.poster.avif?t=1753125922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459370/extras/ae6f82788f2e4b9f0979228b6e4c9da4.webm?t=1753125922\" type=\"video/w